<title>USA: Quantum plans $450 mln shelf debt/stock.</title>
<headline>Quantum plans $450 mln shelf debt/stock.</headline>
<dateline>MILPITAS, Calif. 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quantum Corp said Thursday it will make a shelf filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission for up to $450 million of debt securities, common stock or a combination of the two.</p>
<p>Net proceeds would be used for general corporate purposes, including capital expenditures, and to meet working capital requirements, it said.</p>
